5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to find out where the money is actually going! I'll check the loan transport costs over three seasons and the mount-making charges and joiner's rate.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I am concerned about the human resources available for these installations. I will examine the conservation lab staffing and backlog, as well as the composition of the volunteer roster.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,I prefer to look at the actual impact on the public. I will review the five years of visitor comment slips and the weekend head counts across ten seasons.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to ensure the gallery can physically and operationally handle the next installation. I will examine the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings in the gallery.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I want to make sure we can actually deliver on our promises to the visitors. I shall look into the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
