56,3,1,talk,Mio,,"I think Candidate A is the best! It's local, so shipping costs should be low, and the demonstration sessions would make the visitors super happy without needing expensive mounts!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with Mio. Candidate A is the most sustainable choice. It avoids the conservation backlog, doesn't require heavy rigging in the suspended bay, and utilizes the local history expertise of our volunteers.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Shion,,"Candidate A is the only one that actually addresses the visitor's desire for a human presence. The demonstration sessions turn a static room into a living one, which is exactly what brings people back.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Candidate A is the most logical choice. It avoids the weight risks of the suspended bay and the fragility issues associated with evening hires, while remaining operationally lean.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"I must agree with you all. Candidate A is a lovely choice; it avoids the stress of distant lenders and temperamental electronics, ensuring we can welcome our guests with a smile and no apologies.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Mio,,"It's like we're all on the same page! Candidate A just feels right—it's friendly, budget-friendly, and won't make our staff cry. I'm totally voting for the Textiles of the Region!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"It is rare to find such immediate consensus, but the logic is sound. Candidate A respects our staffing limits and the physical constraints of the gallery. I am voting for Textiles of the Region.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Shion,,"It is almost too easy. While the others focus on the logistics, I am satisfied that A is the only option that guarantees the engagement the public actually wants. I vote for Candidate A.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"The other options are far too risky. B requires rigging and power, C involves heavy cargo loans, and D brings a conservation bench into a space that must remain functional for hires. I vote for Candidate A.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is such a joy to see us all in agreement. Candidate A is a gentle, heartwarming project that respects our limits and celebrates our community. I shall happily cast my vote for the Textiles of the Region.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Mio,,I'm so happy we all agree! It's a win-win for the budget and the visitors. I'm sticking with my vote for Candidate A!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I remain firm in my decision. Candidate A is the only proposal that does not place an impossible burden on our depleted staff or risk the integrity of the gallery. My vote is for A.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Shion,,"I have no reason to change my mind. The data on visitor behavior is clear, and Candidate A is the only one that aligns with it. My vote remains with A.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Asuka,,My position is unchanged. Candidate A is the only proposal that aligns with the structural and operational realities of the building. I vote for Candidate A.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I feel a wonderful sense of peace knowing we have found a path that is kind to our staff and our visitors alike. My heart is set on Candidate A.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,4,talk,Mio,,Yay! I'm so excited! Let's make this the best exhibition ever! My final vote is for Candidate A!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,4,talk,Victoria,,My final vote is for Candidate A. It is the only choice that ensures the work is manageable for the people actually standing in the room.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,4,talk,Shion,,The result is inevitable. Candidate A is the only choice that transforms the gallery from a silent warehouse into a destination. My final vote is for Candidate A.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,4,talk,Asuka,,The evidence is conclusive. Candidate A is the only proposal that respects the structural limits of the suspended bay and the operational needs of the gallery. My final vote is for Candidate A.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,It has been such a pleasure working with you all today. Let us move forward with a light heart and a clear plan. My final vote is for Candidate A.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
